    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:703e1efd7e1ce25d1babc629",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        84,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/84/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3f8d8489f5faad1d37092d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就像挺过严寒的水仙一样，\n坚韧不拔地奔驰到最后——\n并在终点，绽放出属于我的光彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d03c72651bc4083b8939ea77efb08af258f3f67c40328942cfcaa53c4afc104",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        84,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/84/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:917e8ede478718b867b3b200",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        85,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/85/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d92563c9768c7ed7bd3de4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以请您，\n千万不要为我担心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c892ab3e5d3d7eae7ce234d46992bb685b61808984e2ac0a654c94c303b0579",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        85,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/85/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3fe0cd6cd13e7f58fb4bf74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（本以为是自己在担心她，结果反倒被担心了）",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4ba1d7dce3b4c63b1cbe83ed668102ed0ac0b5ec153cb7d63fe52e0935261a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        86,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/86/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b3cccc22194cd23dbbc8de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――她微微行了个礼，便向宿舍走去。\n我只能站在原地，默默地望着她的背影，\n说不出话来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e86ac0e6875ac9d3f9ee9e03a50343f396c72ddb54cca9490161ea89a098235",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        86,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/86/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40cb1409678e8d5d00d8fa27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不禁挺直了脊梁。\n她，正在一步一个脚印地坚实成长着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8e4ea4272de232ff4db1d4a79152f0e1a54a2ba21fa2d4b7d5fccd7a9cb4b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        87,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/87/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46eb06b80af09c6509773f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，为了不落在她的身后，\n在这新的一年里，我也必须竭尽所能地去支持她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2320cb1363d7e01679c541eb7fd8338ce5f75a1beee5737b7afec5b3d078ff7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        88,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/88/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9072691248f8b9955a766359",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目是在11月底举行、汇聚了国内外各路强手的\nGⅠ赛事『日本杯』上——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a0a7d149fca2e643f98c3339c1de86b8bc5e0981d7021f8010b9ba19c099384",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ceffa535109831e2252bb62c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新年的抱负",
      "source_fingerprint": "301e19ba7373c79d5205d8b8fd4b7a26d533a4cf0961299472308824994cd9e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac2483af99fb1402ebfd3e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――元旦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f33ec09f6097b4b19f25d90eaf294240f30d0fc2f201842a2a39c04cb6f03c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f8b0857284cf0a3e2a0ff25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在机伶金花的提议下，\n我们来看新年的第一次日出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b3d9ec1eaafe5f48dbd19e8f32d8f852d4c7cd91a86107f951d27eb5083a27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54b5b2bb6e66f3beb2028a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
