    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88128d2702a1c934b0e2d535",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是“一起休息吧”――哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "343da9bc0cad84547e2364c594dcb58e16a6df3382ba2fd4f0520aa63a5320e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8d83dacf5604d36ebfc1fa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后，一边用她买回来的\n咖啡取暖，\n一边继续等待着日出――",
      "source_fingerprint": "38bc1adf7b77c44b9b04911c9c1ee55e080f1644aa1866f83985f094c5788b39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9db0c4264d63fa4fa0e5d74c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "去车里睡一会怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7df9380da1af6ff2f31dac3d0733cba0bc0eae26de5049dcef8f2ef2dcc89bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
